@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/recyclers
# JWT + RBAC: access token de un usuario con la concesión (401 sin token, 403 sin permiso).
@token = <access_token>

### deactivate: baja lógica (status = inactive) -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/6/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### getAll: el reciclador desactivado ya no aparece
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### delete: borrado físico -> 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### delete: id ya eliminado o inexistente -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
